/// 🌲 `JpgFrameChange`'s tag prefix: `M[fields-diff]` (Modify) / `R[frame-opt]` (Replace) — mirrors
/// `enc_xml_node`/`enc_node_diff`'s single-letter-tag convention (svg/gif precedent).
