    dec_edge, dec_face, dec_vertex, enc_edge, enc_face, enc_vertex, BrepCurve, BrepEdge, BrepFace, BrepLoop, BrepLoopEdge, BrepShell, BrepShellFace, BrepSolid, BrepSolidShell, BrepSurface, BrepVertex, SemioBrepSnapshot,
