/// 🧩 3-way flag (`0`=unchanged/absent, `1`=cleared-to-`None`, `2`=set-to-`Some(value)`) for every
/// TRI-STATE `Option<Option<T>>` field — same shape as png's/gif's own doc comment (avoids
